            "sid": "REV 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I saw another angel flying high in the air, with an eternal message of Good News to announce to the peoples of the earth, to every race, tribe, language, and nation. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said in a loud voice, “Honour God and praise his greatness! For the time has come for him to judge. Worship him who made heaven, earth, sea, and the springs of water!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
