          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A third angel followed the first two, saying in a loud voice, “Whoever worships the beast and its image and receives the mark on their forehead or on their hand ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.51.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 51.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 19.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.38.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 38.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will themselves drink God's wine, the wine of his fury, which he has poured at full strength into the cup of his anger! All who do this will be tormented in fire and sulphur before the holy angels and the Lamb. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.34.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 34.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The smoke of the fire that torments them goes up for ever and ever. There is no relief day or night for those who worship the beast and its image, for anyone who has the mark of its name.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
